::GEO_U04_L07_Q25::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U04_L07_Q25<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.TRI.5<br><br>Question:<br>A right triangle has angle A with adjacent side 12 and hypotenuse 13. Which ratio can be used to find angle A? {
